<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοει-κός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽβοῦσ̓</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόειος</span>
			, <i>of</i> or <i>for oxen</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεύγη β.</span> wagons <i>drawn by oxen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.128
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.5.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				109
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέας β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					6.55
				</span></i>
			:—the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοϊκός</span></b> , freq. in codd. as in <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.87
			</span></i>, is censured by Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.416
			</span></i>, but cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερεῖον βοϊκόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					1(7).203a
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία βοϊκή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					112.109
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοϊκά</span>,
				=
			<i>oxen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1158
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Elis</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. κτήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1189.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>.</div>
